      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MURPHY MULLAN are delighted to present this large extended three bedroomed family home for sale.  \r\n\r\nNo 22 has a number of bonus features including its excellent location, large extension, garage and south facing garden making this one for the short list!\r\n\r\nThe location is simply superb with the Phoenix Park on its door step providing both country and city living in the heart of Dublin with stunning walks and scenery.  There are excellent local schools and a host of shops and necessary amenities. With an excellent public transport system to and from Dublin City Centre with both the N3 and M50 close by providing easy access to most route ways.  Broombridge green luas line is only 15 minutes walk making many locations easily accessible.\r\n\r\nWell-proportioned accommodation includes porch, entrance hallway, reception room, living room, kitchen/dining room. Downstairs W/C and garage. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, a study and a family bathroom.  \r\n\r\nOutside the property is further complimented by a large driveway and gated walled garden. The rear garden is sunny and south facing with part patio area and part lawned.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n22 Villa Park Gardens, Dublin 7\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch:\r\n\t\tA small porch to the front leading to main front door.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway:\t\tCarpeted, a large bright hallway\r\n\r\nFront Reception Room:\t\tCarpeted. Feature fireplace with open fire. \r\n\r\nBack Living Room:\t\tA large extended south facing room with great natural light.\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\n\t\tA large extended kitchen with wooden Kitchen presses top and bottom. Lino flooring\r\nUnder stairs storage:\r\n\t\tSmall storage room\r\nGarage\r\n\t\tLarge garage with potential to convert subject to PP. Housing gas boiler\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC:\t\tFully tiled downstairs toilet with wash hand basin.\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t\tLarge single bedroom  / Carpeted\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  \t\tA spacious double bedroom. Carpeted with built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t\tA large double bedroom. Carpeted with built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nStudy:\t\t\r\nDouble Room. Carpeted\r\n\r\nMain bathroom:\r\n\t\t\r\nA Fully tiled bathroom with shower cubicle with triton shower, WC and wash hand basin\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nFront:  Large front garden lawned, walled and gated with large driveway\r\nRear: Sunny South Facing. Part lawn part sandstone patio slabs"
      },
